{com}.         label var       d1_diff_wtp_taste_noinfo "Day 1: 584 minus 793 WTP after taste, before info"
{txt}
{com}. 
. * Setting up the INFORMED branch and then calculating the WTP difference 584-793
.         gen             d1_mag_wtp_info = .
